---
const creds = [
  { n: '20', l: 'lat marketingu i digitalu' },
  { n: '10', l: 'lat B2B SaaS growth' },
  { n: '200+', l: 'wdrożonych aplikacji i systemów' },
  { n: '36', l: 'odcinków programu' },
];

const stack = [
  'Claude · GPT · Gemini',
  'Clay · Pipedrive · HubSpot',
  'n8n · Make · Zapier',
  'Notion · Linear · D1',
  'Astro · Cloudflare Workers',
];
---
<section class="ac-section ac-bio-section" id="prowadzacy">
  <p class="ac-section-eyebrow reveal-up">Prowadzący</p>
  <h2 class="reveal-up delay-1">Nie ekspert od AI. Operator, który ma to wdrożone u siebie.</h2>

  <div class="ac-bio-wrap">
    <div class="ac-bio-photo reveal-up">
      <img
        src="/wojciech-avatar.webp"
        alt="Wojciech Łuszczyński"
        width="320"
        height="320"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      />
      <span class="ac-bio-badge" aria-hidden="true">
        <span></span>
        live
      </span>
    </div>

    <div class="ac-bio-text reveal-up delay-1">
      <p class="ac-bio-lead">
        Wojciech Łuszczyński. GTM Architect, growth operator, AI-native builder.
        Robię to, czego uczę: prowadzę systemy revenue dla B2B SaaS,
        buduję własne aplikacje i agenty, pracuję codziennie na tych samych narzędziach,
        które poznasz w programie.
      </p>
      <p class="ac-bio-body">
        Akademia nie powstała z research papers. Powstała z trzech lat realnej pracy
        z AI w marketingu, sprzedaży i CRM, z błędów, które kosztowały godziny,
        i z workflow, które kosztują dziś minuty. Każdy odcinek to pojedyncza decyzja,
        nie wykład: który model, do czego, w jakim miejscu procesu.
      </p>

      <div class="ac-bio-creds">
        {creds.map((c, i) => (
          <div class="ac-bio-cred" style={`transition-delay:${i * 60}ms`}>
            <strong>{c.n}</strong>
            <span>{c.l}</span>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>

      <div class="ac-bio-stack" aria-label="Stack, na którym pracuję">
        <p>Stack, którego używam codziennie:</p>
        <ul>
          {stack.map((s) => <li>{s}</li>)}
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="ac-bio-links">
        <a href="https://wojciech.io/about/" rel="noopener">Pełny profil →</a>
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/wojciech-luszczynski/" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>
        <a href="https://app.wojciech.io" rel="noopener">Apps</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .ac-bio-section { padding-top: 96px; padding-bottom: 96px; }

  .ac-bio-wrap {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 320px 1fr;
    gap: 48px;
    align-items: start;
    margin-top: 40px;
  }

  .ac-bio-photo {
    position: relative;
    width: 320px;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    border-radius: 24px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,140,40,0.18), rgba(255,90,20,0.06));
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,140,40,0.22);
    box-shadow: 0 24px 60px -28px rgba(255,120,40,0.4);
  }
  .ac-bio-photo img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
    filter: saturate(1.05) contrast(1.02);
  }
  .ac-bio-badge {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 14px;
    left: 14px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 6px 12px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(10,10,12,0.78);
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,140,40,0.35);
    color: var(--text-1);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .ac-bio-badge > span:first-child {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #ff8c28;
    box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(255,140,40,0.7);
    animation: ac-bio-pulse 1.8s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  @keyframes ac-bio-pulse {
    0%, 100% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
    50% { opacity: 0.55; transform: scale(1.25); }
  }

  .ac-bio-lead {
    font-size: 19px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--text-1);
    font-weight: 500;
    margin: 0 0 18px 0;
  }
  .ac-bio-body {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--text-2);
    margin: 0 0 28px 0;
  }

  .ac-bio-creds {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }
  .ac-bio-cred {
    padding: 16px 14px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.025);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,140,40,0.14);
    transition: border-color 0.3s, transform 0.3s;
  }
  .ac-bio-cred:hover {
    border-color: rgba(255,140,40,0.35);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }
  .ac-bio-cred strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: 26px;
    color: #ff8c28;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .ac-bio-cred span {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-3);
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  .ac-bio-stack {
    padding: 18px 20px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .ac-bio-stack p {
    margin: 0 0 10px 0;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-3);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  }
  .ac-bio-stack ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .ac-bio-stack li {
    padding: 6px 12px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(255,140,40,0.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,140,40,0.18);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-2);
    font-family: var(--font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace);
  }

  .ac-bio-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 22px;
  }
  .ac-bio-links a {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-2);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,140,40,0.4);
    padding-bottom: 2px;
    transition: color 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
  }
  .ac-bio-links a:hover {
    color: #ff8c28;
    border-bottom-color: #ff8c28;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .ac-bio-wrap {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 32px;
    }
    .ac-bio-photo {
      width: 200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .ac-bio-creds {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }
</style>
